  "description": "Get into the festive spirit with this Cute Christmas Seamless Pattern Bundle!\nThis delightful collection includes 10 adorable holiday designs featuring Santa Claus, reindeer, snowmen, gingerbread men, Christmas trees, bows, candy canes, dogs, golden retrievers, and even cherries with a festive twist — all in soft pastel and bright Christmas tones of red, green, pink, and cream.\nEach pattern is hand-drawn and seamless, perfect for wrapping paper, holiday cards, fabric prints, gift tags, digital paper, stickers, and Christmas crafts.\nThe mix of classic Christmas motifs and modern pastel palettes adds a fun, joyful, and cozy feel to your seasonal projects.\n❤️ You will receive\n✅ 10 PNG files\n✅ 12 x 12 inches\n✅ High resolution 300 DPI\n✅ Seamless Pattern\n❌ Not editable",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Get into the festive spirit with this Cute Christmas Seamless Pattern Bundle!<br>\nThis delightful collection includes 10 adorable holiday designs featuring Santa Claus, reindeer, snowmen, gingerbread men, Christmas trees, bows, candy canes, dogs, golden retrievers, and even cherries with a festive twist — all in soft pastel and bright Christmas tones of red, green, pink, and cream.<br>\nEach pattern is hand-drawn and seamless, perfect for wrapping paper, holiday cards, fabric prints, gift tags, digital paper, stickers, and Christmas crafts.<br>\nThe mix of classic Christmas motifs and modern pastel palettes adds a fun, joyful, and cozy feel to your seasonal projects.</p>\n<p>❤️ You will receive<br>\n✅ 10 PNG files<br>\n✅ 12 x 12 inches<br>\n✅ High resolution 300 DPI<br>\n✅ Seamless Pattern<br>\n❌ Not editable</p>",
